<p align="center"><b><font face="Tahoma" size="4">Vexare -- News Details</font></b></p>
<table border=0 width=100% cellpadding=2 cellspacing=0>

	<tr align=left vAlign=top class=NewsHeader>
		<td width=10% vAlign=top>09/28/2002</td>
		<td vAlign=top width=90%>Crusaders of Skyshrine Part Deux</td>
	</tr>
	<tr vAlign=top class=NewsHeadline>
		<td width=10% align=center><IMG border=0 height=84 src="/images/torch.gif" width=31></td>
		<td align=left width=90%><P><font color=Gold>Posted by Carthington Severing</font><BR><BR><p>Ok, lets get something straight, we're in <b>SKYSHRINE</b>, right?  WRONG!  I have a much tougher time licking Tserrina's Crack!  These mobs rank right up there with the Wing Dings of NToV, and as soon as I install my photoshop again, I'll put up our pics and show you why.  Nothing special about these wankers, except they're big, fat, and can spit saliva on you from Yelinak's lair.

<p>Ok, enough of the bad jokes here, what did they drop this time besides their goo when they died??

<ul>
<li>Grendish the Crusader
<ul>
<li>Easirok - Lifegiver's Tome</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Jortreva the Crusader
<ul>
<li>Ogdon - Amulet of the Shrine</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Susarrak the Crusader
<ul>
<li>Angeleyes - Rod of the Healers</li>
<li>Deicide - Necklace of the Sages</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>Charayan the Crusader
<ul>
<li>Angeleyes alt - Aegis of Shrine</li>
<li>Chmadler - Sceptre of the Shrine</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>

<p>And there you have it, more gifts from a box of Frosted Mini Wheats!

<p>Why did the chicken cross the road?  BECAUSE THE SKYSHRINE CRUSADERS COULDN'T FIGURE OUT WHICH WOULD EMPREGNATE THE CHICKEN!!  So while they were debating, he ran for its life, for the rest of its life.

<center><b>Same blue guy, same Vexare channel!</b></center></td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr align=left vAlign=top class=NewsHeader>
		<td width=10% vAlign=top>09/27/2002</td>
		<td vAlign=top width=90%>The Crusaders of Skyshrine</td>
	</tr>
	<tr vAlign=top class=NewsHeadline>
		<td width=10% align=center><IMG border=0 height=84 src="/images/torch.gif" width=31></td>
		<td align=left width=90%><P><font color=Gold>Posted by Dacronis</font><BR><BR>The night was set with anticipation, to see what ungodly things had appeared in Skyshrine. So the brave members of Vexare ventured in and the following testimonial is the shit we knocked the Fuck OUT!!
<br>
<br>
<H6 align=center>First on the fight card was Grendish the Crusader<br><img src="http://members.aol.com/daclifster/images/grendish2.jpg"></H6>
<br>
<br>
<H6 align=center>Then I went to go pick a fight with Jorteva the Crusader<br><img src="http://members.aol.com/daclifster/images/jortreva.jpg"></H6>
<br>
<br>
<H6 align=center>Susarrak the Crusader fell to the might of Vexare fast then the previous crusaders.<br><img src="http://members.aol.com/daclifster/images/susarrak.jpg"></H6>
<br>
<br>
<H6 align=center>The final Crusader to keep Lord Yelinak Safe was Charayan the Crusader.<br><img src="http://members.aol.com/daclifster/images/charayan.jpg"></H6>
<br>
All in all was a fun filled night for a Vexare and a Server first ANYWHERE!! We look forward to the bug fixes that will improve this encounter for everyone and stay tuned for more phat l3wtz!!






</td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr align=left vAlign=top class=NewsHeader>
		<td width=10% vAlign=top>09/26/2002</td>
		<td vAlign=top width=90%>Avatar of War is dead</td>
	</tr>
	<tr vAlign=top class=NewsHeadline>
		<td width=10% align=center><IMG border=0 height=84 src="/images/torch.gif" width=31></td>
		<td align=left width=90%><P><font color=Gold>Posted by Carthington Severing</font><BR><BR><p>It doesn't matter if you win with 100 people or 10 people, a win is a win, and Avatar of War felt the pain!  Yes ladies and gentlemen, he crapped out more poop than ever before when he died!  What we didn't want to see is what he had to eat...Here in the picture we have five figures.  These are your local Vexare officers, they can be found in a video yelling "THUNDERBOLT!  THUNDERBOLT!"  Siskel and Ebert gave this a two thumbs up also!<br>
<br>
<img src="http://members.aol.com/daclifster/images/aow925.jpg">
<br>

<p>But what we DID want to see is his loot, and he dropped these lovely wonderful "Price Is Right" items that can only be bought at a local retailer near you...

<ul>
<li>Tudin - Blade of Carnage</li>
<li>Nairrin - Flayed Barbarian Hide Mask</li>
<li>Shig - War Bow of Rallos Zek</li>
</ul>

<p>I personally think that Avatar of War been licking too much booty just so he can *try* to be tough... but hey, we all do that. Just remember, don't walk around Kael Drakkal at night, don't try to grab a coldain husky by its tail, and don't let people tell you that giants like to mate with dwarves....  they just have kids who come out really...wierd.

<p><center><b>Same blue guy, same Vexare channel!</b></center></td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr align=left vAlign=top class=NewsHeader>
		<td width=10% vAlign=top>09/25/2002</td>
		<td vAlign=top width=90%>Xerkizh the Creator</td>
	</tr>
	<tr vAlign=top class=NewsHeadline>
		<td width=10% align=center><IMG border=0 height=84 src="/images/torch.gif" width=31></td>
		<td align=left width=90%><P><font color=Gold>Posted by Carthington Severing</font><BR><BR><p>......stood a mob that only Mr Clean would be proud to handle - Xerkizh the Crapper!  My goodness, can we get any gimpier of a name?  Xerkizh the Creator...who does this snake thinks he is?  He sounds like a kitchen utility that got stuck in the sink!  We might have to call the Turd of Ssreazha to come help this guy out!  Wow, I can smell him from zone in....well, we flushed him, and this is what floated...

<ul>
<li>Zsewr - Shield of the Creator</li>
<li>Thomaas - Mournfollow</li>
<li>Nairrin - Soft Scale Slippers</li>
</ul>

<p>Too bad, he didn't drop his better loot...I feel for these people....he craps that crap and they had to wipe

<p>Next was Dain...again....fee fi fo fum I smell the turd that is stuck on his thumb...he used his butt to pick up that crumb, then ate it like Ollie the Magic Bum (from tony hawk pro skater 2).  Unlike the bum, Dain did drop these....

<ul>
<li>Angeleyes' alt - Frostreaver</li>
<li>Ironheart - Dain's Head</li>
</ul>

<p>I hope he can do better next time...

<p><center><b>Same blue guy, same Vexare channel!</b><center></td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr align=left vAlign=top class=NewsHeader>
		<td width=10% vAlign=top>09/23/2002</td>
		<td vAlign=top width=90%>4 days later...</td>
	</tr>
	<tr vAlign=top class=NewsHeadline>
		<td width=10% align=center><IMG border=0 height=84 src="/images/torch.gif" width=31></td>
		<td align=left width=90%><P><font color=Gold>Posted by Carthington Severing</font><BR><BR><p>It is now 4 days later, and the audience trembles and holds their breath as they listen for the latest news....

<p>Get a freaking life!!!!

<p>What have we done in the past 4 days?  Well I'll tell you....

<ul>
<li>Itraer Vius</li>
<li>Cazic Thule</li>
<li>Dain Frostreaver IV</li>
</ul>

<p>Such fond memories...  I wonder though, back in the old days, did Cazic feather his butes?  Does he have any?  He's faceless, but is he...well you know...

<p>Itraer Vius, on the 19th, was a sight to see yet again!  Does he ever change those rags of his?  I mean come on, I know he's poor and all but he kills people every day you'd think he'd snatch some panties or something to wear!  Well, so much for getting our hopes up for a different look, but the poor guy did give us these....

<ul>
<li>Phos - Vex Xi Vius</li>
<li>Anissa - Orb of Luclinite</li>
</ul>

<p>What the hell is a Vex Xi Vius?  That sounds like something I'd wipe my rear with after I've taken a crap out in the middle of Iceclad!  Honestly, can we get some real stuff with more understandable names?

<p>Then, on the 20th, we went to kill this faceless hairy ugly hairy stanky brown squishy stinky nugget they call Cazic Thule!  What the hell?  Didn't I just crap this out last week when I ate that Norrathian Scarab Platter with a touch of Filet O'Orc delight?  He closely matches that of a huge turd only without the smell...even poor Dain looks better than this guy!  He did drop these goodies (finally) that were considered above cracker jack prizes...

<ul>
<li>Groo - Cloak of the Fearsome</li>
<li>Maximal - Halo of the Enlightened</li>
<li>Muez - Eye of Cazic Thule</li>
<li>Milven - Robe of Inspiration</li>
</ul>

<p>Ok, what the hell?  Where did that eye come from?  Did that big ball of turd gobble up some poor chump while he was dragging through fear one day?  Or was that after Sterculis, God of all Turds to be turn him into the walking crap-man he is today?  But just think, kids buying boxes of Lucky Charms now rejoice on these drops...

<p>Then on the 21st, we did something...  wow, crickets sure are loud today...

<p>Now on the 22nd, we decided to visit Dain again.  Yeah yeah, he didn't have his hammer today.  Sorry guys, we know you liked him and that hammer but the groping contest never happened...
<p>His complexion on the other hand went from white to red as he died and dropped crap that I don't think Sanford and Son would take in their junk yard...  look at this...

<ul>
<li>Etars - Frostreaver's Velium Crown</li>
<li>Traeumerx - Frostreaver's Velium Crown</li>
<li>Razildon - Dain Frostreaver's Head</li>
</ul>

<p>At least I still got me lucky charms!

<p>That is all for now people!<br><br>

<center><b>Same blue guy!  Same Vexare channel!</b></center>
<center>Good day!</center></td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr align=left vAlign=top class=NewsHeader>
		<td width=10% vAlign=top>09/19/2002</td>
		<td vAlign=top width=90%>10th Ring War</td>
	</tr>
	<tr vAlign=top class=NewsHeadline>
		<td width=10% align=center><IMG border=0 height=84 src="/images/torch.gif" width=31></td>
		<td align=left width=90%><P><font color=Gold>Posted by Carthington Severing</font><BR><BR><p>Well, it seems that the family fued continues as years pass...  lonely giants and dwarfs fight over one thing...  a ring... waiting in Great Divide all this time, Lonely giants and dwarfs who had never had sex, not even with their local priest.  To show you what I mean, check this out....

<p>This is your typical giant....he's hairy.. he's tall..  and then you see monkeys crawling by the hundreds...<br>
<img src="http://www.deltaz.net/images/battlepic9.jpg">

<p>This is your typical dwarf....This one is female...wow, thats the last time she'll ever see male genitalia again!<br>
<img src="http://www.deltaz.net/images/battlepic6.jpg">

<p>And this is your typical combatant asked to be in the middle of it all.  Not an attrative man as you can see.  His name is This Guy and he thinks he has a chance with that female dwarf!<br>
<img src="http://www.deltaz.net/images/battlepic5.jpg">

<p>This was a battle line set up by the giants who used pure intellect to fight this battle....<br>
<img src="http://www.deltaz.net/images/battlepic4.jpg">

<p>And here we see a sexually deprived kromzek spearman getting frustrated because he didn't get any action what so ever!  At least he still has his spear.<br>
<img src="http://www.deltaz.net/images/battlepic3.jpg">

<p>This place has become a wimpy, whining, brady bunch version of itself, and all we had to do was kill a guy named... Narandi!  Narandi is on crack!  He had his lance gripped tight and ready to spew forth the kind of terror that the singing fat lady can only dream about...<br>
<img src="http://www.deltaz.net/images/battlepic12.jpg">

<p>Now on to the battle....
<p>What is this?  Tell me they are trying to get organized?<br>
<img src="http://www.deltaz.net/images/battlepic2.jpg">
<p>So far so good, I'm sure Ollie North would be proud!  But the fight begins, and it goes on...and on...<br>
<img src="http://www.deltaz.net/images/battlepic11.jpg">
<p>Until finally our good friend This Guy shows up to offer some wisdom for the Kromzek Virgins!  Maybe the giants formed a guild?  Virgins of the Kromzek Kings?  This Guy is here to give advice, but it doesn't seem to be helping much.<br>
<img src="http://www.deltaz.net/images/battlepic7.jpg">
<p>As you can see, so far all of the giants are wielding something long and hard.  I think they're trying to tell us something...

<p>Look at this!  Look at this!  Through the invisibility, the giants found an actual girl here!  <br>
<img src="http://www.deltaz.net/images/battlepic8.jpg"><br>
<p>Not too shabby around here, huh honey?  The giant - female ratio, yes?  You got your veritable pick of the litter!  You can choose from almost all kinds of giants who have no idea how to please you!

<p>So the battle continues!  Who will win?  The giant virgins or the white turds of thurgadin??  Know one knew until the crack dood showed up to finally uhh...well, give his take on Sexual Adversities of Velious© which can be checked out at various libraries around Norrath.  Not that I ever checked it out though, I don't have these kinds of problems....<br>
<img src="http://www.deltaz.net/images/battlepic1.jpg"><img src="http://www.deltaz.net/images/battlepic10.jpg">

<p>Did I mention that this was for our good friend Kardvyne?  I mean, he thought Dain was a pretty cool dood!  He went through all this just to get a ring for his wedding with that female dwarf from earlier!  BTW, he thanks everyone, and with enough practice on his sister in Neriak, he'll be ready for the wedding in a few weeks!<br>
<img src="http://www.deltaz.net/images/battleend1.jpg">

<p>And that was the 10th Ring War!  Such brave warriors go out of their way for one person!  What selfless service!

<p>And in all serious congratz to Kardvine on his ring and all the loot winners!

<ul>
<li>Rezzi - Choker of the Wretched</li>
<li>Xero - Faceguard of Benatos the Hero</li>
<li>Zsewr - Nerandi's Lance</li>
<li>and what about Crown of Nerandi? Ask the dood who wasn't invited that got one of the hero's killed...</li>
</ul>

<center><b><p>Same blue guy!  Same Vexare Channel!  Good Night everyone!</b></center></td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr align=left vAlign=top class=NewsHeader>
		<td width=10% vAlign=top>09/19/2002</td>
		<td vAlign=top width=90%>Giant Crap andToV the Third Coming</td>
	</tr>
	<tr vAlign=top class=NewsHeadline>
		<td width=10% align=center><IMG border=0 height=84 src="/images/torch.gif" width=31></td>
		<td align=left width=90%><P><font color=Gold>Posted by Carthington Severing</font><BR><BR><p>Yeah yeah, what we got here...I wasn't born yesterday!  Last night King Tormax was a bad dood!  Yeah!  He faced the wall and got slammed and screwed!  BOING!  I'm not sure if he was coming or going but this guy is getting his money from somewhere...  look what he dropped!

<ul>
<li>Easirok - Boots of the Storm</li>
<li>Sanistan - Crown of the Kromzek Kings</li>
<li>Venomace - Crown of the Kromzek Kings</li>
<li>Druncky - Wristguard of Thunder</li>
<li>Smokepaw - King Tormax's Head</li>
<li>Phos - Hsagra's Shard</li>
</ul>

<p>Not too bad on the loot...I can live off that, almost as good as the white hair dood in the movie "The Jerk" (Rated R, Restricted)

<p>"Who dares to defile the Temple of Rallos Zek?"
<p>"You shall not defile the Temple of Rallos Zek!"
<p>"Who's going to be the first to take a crap in the Temple of Rallos Zek?!"

<p>We were such big fans of King Tormax we went to see his little brother Derakor the Vindicator.  THEN WE KICKED HIS ASS!!  You think we were screwing around?  Ooooh no!  Ask him how it felt without slow and defensive disc!!!  WHATS OUR NAME?  WHATS OUR NAME?  OOOOHH...  And then we took his crap too....

<ul>
<li>Thomaas - Chestplate of Vindication</li>
<li>Etars - Vindi's Head</li>
</ul>

<p>Well, that was fun...  but where's the real action?  In ToV baby!  For the third night!  Wow, quite interesting...  but I know whats going on here, especially in velious...   that place keeps getting colder than a coldain tracking wolve's...umm....  yeah

<p>Well, was fun...  5 dragons...  quite a turn out as you can see!  Guilds have come as far as zone in just to get a chance to die here!  Look at these dragons, such famous dragons...   thats right before Veeshan flew by and picked them up!  But in other news, here is what we got...

<p>Jorllaeg<ul>
<li>Rezzi - Onyx Chain Leggings</li>
<li>Winolwen - Onyx Chain Leggings</li>
</ul>

<p>Lady Nevederia<ul>
<li>Tridawn - Nevederia's Claw</li>
</ul>

<p>Zlexak<ul>
<li>Angeleyes - Tvenken's Slippers of Silence</li>
<li>Guthurm - Dragonspine Rapier</li>
</ul>

<p>Cekenar<ul>
<li>Taylen - Frost Spike</li>
</ul>

<p>Sevalak<ul>
<li>Phos - Shield of Midnight</li>
</ul>

<p>Nice loot, very uber....   next time I go to the store I'll be sure to pick up me a box of Lucky Charms!  Who thinks of these things?  Anyhow, this is such a historic night!  Such a unique night!  Such an unbelievable and undeniable chemistry!  We got to watch 5 dragons crap as they died!  We can smell their poo all the way from Freeport!

<p>That is it for today!

<p>Same blue guy, same vexare channel!  Good Night everyone!</td>
	</tr>
	
	<tr align=left vAlign=top class=NewsHeader>
		<td width=10% vAlign=top>09/17/2002</td>
		<td vAlign=top width=90%>More raiding...</td>
	</tr>
	<tr vAlign=top class=NewsHeadline>
		<td width=10% align=center><IMG border=0 height=84 src="/images/torch.gif" width=31></td>
		<td align=left width=90%><P><font color=Gold>Posted by Carthington Severing</font><BR><BR><p>Well, no pictures to satisfy your x rated needs but what I can say is that we did flush five more turds last night!  What we got here?  Well, we have the ugly dwarf known as the Dain sending out his brand of uhh..  queer messages all over Icewell Keep .... "The court of Dain is now in session!  The court of Dain is not in session!"...The court of Dain royally sucks!  Not an attractive dwarf is he?  When he goes outside of Thurgadin, the wolves sniff his face!  Get this guy an eye patch please!!  Well we didn't get him an eye patch, we gave him the good ol' Vexare whoopin we usually give to him, and the poor ugly mutt dropped these things....

<ul>
<li>Thomaas - Dain Frostreaver's Head</li>
<li>Ralmun - Frostreaver</li>
<li>Gzagenius - Aegis of Ice</li>
<li>Gzagenius - Frostreaver</li>
</ul>

<p>And then...and then if the ugliness wasn't enough, guess who we just HAD to go look at?  LORD UGLINAK...This guy is so so ugly he makes toilet water that much easier to drink!  His teeth looks like something the Rascals would appreciate!  And to top that off, some of his loot looks like something you'd find in a cracker jack box!  Check this out...

<ul>
<li>Ialaman - Yelinak's Talisman</li>
<li>Xedricii - Very Large Coin Purse</li>
<li>Xero - Very Large Coin Purse</li>
<li>Easirok - Yelinak's Head</li>
<li>Shenna - Dragon's Tear Earring</li>
</ul>

<p>Ok, so the loot wasn't THAT bad, the earring and purses are cracker jack prizes.

<p>Now comes the part of the night where we all can appreciate the Wing Dings once again!  Yes...another buck toothed Rascal wanna be...LORD VYEMM!  His name sounds like something you'd find on the label of mouth wash!  He looks like Uglinak's offspring, though!  He's got the same squinty eyes, the same buck teeth, the same everything.  Some of his loot isn't so cracker jack though...look what he dropped!

<ul>
<li>Venomace - Gaudralek, Sword of the Sky</li>
<li>Naldiian - Vyemm's Right Eye</li>
<li>Anissa - Vyemm's Fang </li>
</ul>

<p>Not too shabby!  Not too shabby at all!  Even Buckwheat would have the time of his life with these!  Oh yes!

