	</tr>
	<tr vAlign=top class=NewsHeadline>
		<td width=10% align=center><IMG border=0 height=84 src="/images/torch.gif" width=31></td>
		<td align=left width=90%><P><font color=Gold>Posted by Dacronis</font><BR><BR>Well, the headline pretty much sums up what happened Saturday night. In a nutshell, the Lead GM decided to penalize me by issuing me a week suspension. This infraction while ridiculous in nature, is based on monitored chat between a vex member and a person in another guild on the server. Because there was a fear we were stalling an encounter to hold another guild back, the Lead GM in his infinite wisdom (of a whole 7 days being on the server) decided that no warning was to be issued to me, no GMs would even communicate with me.. Just suspend me after bending their own calendar rules.  I was not the accused person that made the comments, but being the Guild Leader of Vexare I am held accountable. I find this all in poor taste.
<p>
<p>
I assure you this is far from over. This childish game initiated by a /report to the GMs from one our local Township Rebellion retards. Well this is no shock if you have ever crossed paths with TR, the laughing stocks of the server. It did make us all wiser though, especially me. Do I blame TR, oh hell no. They really can't help themselves; this is what makes them so pathetic and gives us so many things to laugh at.  
<p>
<p>
My disappointment is AGAIN with the GMs on Stormhammer.  Monitoring individual chat basically for the interest of TR's gain is what this comes down to. It shows favoritism and it shows me you’re a piece of shit just like them. Here's where the great part comes in though.... the power is in the word and I can guarantee the GM staff I have enough resources and enough backing to flood customer service with complaints about this everyday for the rest of the year until the right e-mail maybe gets to someone above you that you wouldn't want it to get to, then we will see what happens.
<p>
<p>
In closing my thoughts are of Clownship Rebellion... FUCK YOU
<p>
<p>
<H6 align=center>Words to live by<br><img src="http://members.aol.com/daclifster/images/dacban.jpg"></H6></td>
	</tr>
	
