<li>Dietrich x3 - those rogs think they are invisible to everything :P</li>
<li>a mis-calc by Micra on the "rez-timer" for duel`d corpses</li>
<li>some corpse dragging ghetto CoH</li>
<li>and 1 wiz while waiting to translocate people</li>
</ul>
<P>Congratz: Azzor, Kemal, and Gralix on their epic components
<H3 align=center>Epic Monday 0 - Vexare 4</H3>
<p>Raan Lifebringer
<br>High Priest of Tunare
<br>- - v e X a r e - -</td>
