Vexare is rescued by a troll.&nbsp; Agmar, was quick-thinking enough (yes.. 
believe it or not, a troll was quick-thinking) to /report one of his &quot;punts&quot; out 
of the world.&nbsp; This proved to the GMs what we had been trying to tell them 
for so long.&nbsp; The Lord Yeln encounter is <b>FLAWED</b>.</p>

<p align=center"><img src="images/vexareimages/tier4/lordyeln.jpg"></p>

<p>Well,&nbsp; off to Skyshrine we go, summoned there by the GMs.&nbsp; Standing 
between us and Tier 4 is Lord Yelinak himself; staring menacingly; mocking us to 
try and make Tier 4.&nbsp; </p>

<p align=center><img src="images/vexareimages/tier4/yelinakalive.jpg"></p>

<p>In one of the most flawless preps for Yelinak ever, 
the buff order, buff shield, runes, shellshields, CH line, MT, support melee and casters get into place.</p>

<p align=center><b><font color="#FF0000">&quot;Start CH line is 5seconds!&quot;, shouts Agmar<br>The battle commences.</font></b></p>

<p>For about 4 minutes, clerics are chaining, support healers are patching, the 
MT's are taunting, the support melee are pumping out the DPS, the wizards and 
other casters are nuking, mod-rods are ringing. And!!! Phaedron is dropping the 
DB bomb to the tune of 42000+ damage.&nbsp; At the end of that 4 minutes the 
once great Lord Yelinak lay dead.</p>
<p align=center><img src="images/vexareimages/tier4/yelinakdead.jpg"></p>
<p>What followed next was pure excitement as the server learns:</p>
<p align=center><img src="images/vexareimages/tier4/message.jpg"></p>
<p>To top it all off, since this was a REAL encounter with REAL risks....Vexare 
gets the booty (the loot Tudin, not the female barbarians).</p>
<blockquote>
  <ul>
    <li>
    Yelinak's Head, Gralix
    </li>
    <li>
    Mask of Dragon Slaying, Garon
    </li>
    <li>
    Outriders Taming Whip, Dustinrain
    </li>
    <li>
    Outriders Taming Whip, Destroyed
    </li>
    <li>
    Dragons Blood Earring, Harmalot
    </li>
    <li>
    Yelinaks Talisman (ST key), Smokepaw
    </li>
  </ul>
</blockquote>
<p>Congratulations Vexare.&nbsp; You all deserve special commendation for 
sticking with it.</p>
<p align=center>Raansoon Lifebringer<br>High Priest of Tunare<br>- - v e X a r e</p></td>
	</tr>
	
