		<td align=left width=90%><P><font color=Gold>Posted by Raansoon</font><BR><BR><P>While waiting on the GMs to remove their Cranium from their anus regarding the Tier system, we decided to go to zlandi-mart and get another ST key.  Well, I think the owner of zlandi-mart (zlandicar :P) had been spending too much time with Imia, becuase he told us we didnt belong in his tier, becuase, even though he had been killed by us several times, we had never killed him in the ARENA, where he has a special super-power that reducers the health and mana of everyone in the zone to 10 percent at the start of engagment and every 10minutes thereafter.

<P>Well...  pretending the owner was actually the store-clerk, we proceeded to kick his ass and just take his $h!t from his dead corpse.  To bad we couldnt load his dead body up in the back of the getaway van and dump it on bordeal's front porch.

<H2 align=center>Gratz Garon on the ST key</H2>

<P>After being f^ck&d by the GM on the testing again, the ST key holders that were on went and killed the Master Of The Guard in Sleepers.  Gratz on the following

