<li>Jeraem - Spell: Primal Avatar</li>
<li><font color=gold size=2>Tudin - <b>Primal</b> Warsword</font></li>
</ul>

<P>Yeah, Im a bit irritated with the whole tier thing :P


<P align=center>Raansoon Lifebringer
<br>High Priest of Tunare
<br>- - v e X a r e - -</td>
